Indicates an issue which is related to analyzer experience","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/353","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestone/353","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/milestones/353/labels","id":13180918,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAQzde84AyR_2","number":353,"title":".NET 11 Planning","description":"","creator":{"login":"danroth27","id":1874516,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NzQ1MTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1874516?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27","html_url":"https://github.com/danroth27","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danroth27/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":101,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-07-01T21:05:02Z","updated_at":"2026-08-17T07:24:10Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-08-17T07:24:10Z"},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-01-22T21:45:27Z","updated_at":"2026-06-24T09:56:03Z","closed_at":"2026-06-24T09:56:03Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":{"id":1092406,"node_id":"IT_kwDOAIt-yc4AEKs2","name":"Feature","description":"A request, idea, or new functionality","color":"blue","created_at":"2024-01-25T11:45:43Z","updated_at":"2024-10-08T09:10:05Z","is_enabled":true},"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Add an analyzer that warns of unnecessary StateHasChanged usages.\n\nWhen a component extends ComponentBase, within OnInitialized or OnInitializedAsync, there is no need to call StateHasChanged unless there is more than one `await` on the method.\n\nComponentBase will call StateHasChanged right after the method returns the task and then it will call it again after the task completes. StateHasChanged only queues a render, but it won't be evaluated until the synchronous part of the method finishes. This means that StateHasChanged is only needed to be called explicitly if there is more than one `await` and there is at least one await that doesn't finish synchronously and we want to provide an update on the UI before the method completes.\n\nThis applies to OnInitializedAsync, OnParametersSetAsync and event handlers.\n\nOur analyzer should flag if there is a StateHasChanged() call that happens between the last await on the method and the end of the method, or if it happens right after the first `await` on the method.","closed_by":{"login":"ilonatommy","id":32700855,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzAwODU1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32700855?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy","html_url":"https://github.com/ilonatommy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ilonatommy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65196/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dotnet/aspnetcore/issues/65196/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}